OL,3,GNEWSAWoman denies leaving friend for
OL,4,Adead in flat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has denied murdering her friend
OL,7,Fand leaving her body undiscovered in
OL,8,Fher home for a month, describing her as
OL,9,Fa "cracking girl".
OL,11,FProsecutors allege that Helen
OL,12,FBloomfield, 52, was murdered by Amy
OL,13,FKeely, 40, and Charlotte James, 29, at
OL,14,Fher flat in Braintree, Essex, in March
OL,15,F2024.
OL,17,FDuring her trial at Chelmsford Crown
OL,18,FCourt, Keely denied she ever bragged
OL,19,Fabout killing Bloomfield.
